    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "With the hectic pace of daily living, is it any wonder that sleep comes at a premium? Melatonin helps you leave your busy day behind. Melatonin works in harmony with your natural sleep cycle to give you the tranquil rest you deserve, co you can awaken feeling refreshed. Inspired by the natural rhythm of life, Melatonin is an ideal choice for people experiencing occasional sleeplessness, those with jet lag, or those seeking to improve their quality of rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "DIRECTIONS: For adults, take one (1) tablet at bedtime as Melatonin may produce drowsiness."
